// Typecheck the web app's SOURCE **and** its `test/` files (97 vitest specs that the root
// `vitest run` executes but no tsconfig used to include — tsconfig.json's include is
// `["src", "vite.config.ts"]`).
//
// A separate project rather than widening tsconfig.json's include: that config is what
// `pnpm build` runs before `vite build`, and it is also what the web Docker image typechecks
// — where only @naary/dsl is prebuilt. Test files import more workspace packages than that,
// so folding them in would break the image build. Same reasoning as tsconfig.storybook.json.
//
// Wired into CI by the `typecheck` script in package.json, which the root `pnpm typecheck`
// (`tsc -b && pnpm -r run typecheck`) fans out to. See #1099.
{
  "extends": "./tsconfig.json",
  "include": ["src", "test", "vite.config.ts"]
}
